### 1. Add intersection - Gdansk Center
POST http://localhost:8080/api/intersections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gdansk Center",
  "latitude": 54.3520,
  "longitude": 18.6466
}

### 2. Add intersection - Sopot
POST http://localhost:8080/api/intersections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sopot",
  "latitude": 54.4418,
  "longitude": 18.5601
}

### 3. Add intersection - Gdynia
POST http://localhost:8080/api/intersections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gdynia",
  "latitude": 54.5189,
  "longitude": 18.5305
}

### 4. List all intersections
GET http://localhost:8080/api/intersections

### 5. Add road - Gdansk Center to Sopot
POST http://localhost:8080/api/roads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromId": 1,
  "toId": 2,
  "lengthMeters": 9000,
  "speedLimitKmh": 60
}

### 6. Add road - Sopot to Gdynia
POST http://localhost:8080/api/roads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromId": 2,
  "toId": 3,
  "lengthMeters": 7000,
  "speedLimitKmh": 60
}

### 7. Calculate route: Gdansk Center (1) -> Gdynia (3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/route?fromId=1&toId=3
### 8. Check roads
GET http://localhost:8080/api/roads

### 9. Test single hop: Gdansk (1) -> Sopot (2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/route?fromId=1&toId=2
### 10. Spawn a vehicle: Gdansk Center -> Gdynia
POST http://localhost:8080/api/simulation/spawn?fromId=1&toId=3

### 11. Check active vehicles
GET http://localhost:8080/api/simulation/active